{"seq":1,"slug":"orchestrating-multiple-agents","title":"编排多个 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/team-workflows-and-collaboration/orchestrating-multiple-agents","wordCount":2044,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"编排多个-agent\">编排多个 Agent</h1><p>一个人同时驱动多个 agent 并行工作——一个实现功能、一个写测试、一个调研方案——正从炫技变成日常。但编排不是免费的：Anthropic 自己的多 agent 研究系统在广度优先任务上比单 agent 高出 90.2%，token 消耗却约为普通对话的 15 倍；METR 的随机对照实验则显示，资深开发者在自己最熟悉的仓库里引入 AI 反而慢了 19%。编排的杠杆真实存在，但它有明确的前提与上限，本节把两面都讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>编排是分布式系统，不是加速旋钮</strong>：收益来自「用更多算力换覆盖面」，代价是成倍 token 与新的协调成本。</li>\n<li><strong>最优并行度有解析解</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^* = \\sqrt{T_{\\text{work}} / T_{\\text{coord}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，任务总量越大、协调越便宜，越值得开更多线。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离粒度要匹配任务粒度</strong>：只读任务用独立上下文即可，写入型任务才需要 worktree 级隔离，隔离过度等于亲手调高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>把关产能是硬上界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\le R/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，审查是以人的注意力为单位的串行资源，超出这个界只是更快地生产未审代码。</li>\n<li><strong>收益感知会系统性偏高</strong>：METR 中开发者事前高估 24%、事后仍自估快 20% 而实测慢 19%，是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低估的典型案例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：拆任务按职责不按文件，隔离按任务粒度选机制，把关产能跟不上时先降并行度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单兵到编排者-收益有模型-代价也有\">从单兵到编排者：收益有模型，代价也有</h2><p>Anthropic 在 2025 年 6 月的工程复盘《How we built our multi-agent research system》给出过一组对照数字：以 Claude Opus 4 为主 agent、Sonnet 4 为子 agent 的多 agent 系统，在内部广度优先研究评测上比单 agent Opus 4 高出 90.2%；同一篇复盘也承认，多 agent 系统消耗的 token 约为单轮对话的 15 倍，且 token 用量本身解释了 BrowseComp 评测中约 80% 的性能方差。多 agent 的收益来自「用更多算力换覆盖面」，不是魔法（来源：<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic Engineering</a>）。</p>\n<p>对编排者本人，收益同样有结构。把任务拆给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个并行 agent，总时间可以近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = \\frac{T_{\\text{work}}}{n} + T_{\\text{coord}} \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是拆解、派发、汇总、审查的单位协调成本。对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 求极值可得最优并行度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^* = \\sqrt{T_{\\text{work}} / T_{\\text{coord}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>任务总量越大、协调越便宜，越值得开更多线；强依赖、需频繁对齐的工作会推高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让并行得不偿失。</p>\n<p>角色迁移的实质是注意力的重新分配：编排者不再逐行写代码，而是充当调度器——何时拆线、何时等待、何时介入。产出上限从手速转移到拆解质量与审查吞吐，认知负荷的形态也随之改变：从单线的深度专注，变成多线之间的高频切换与状态跟踪，这是一种容易被低估的新负荷。METR 的实验（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.09089\">arXiv:2507.09089</a>）可读作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被系统性低估的案例：16 名资深开源开发者在自己长期维护的大型仓库（平均 22k+ stars）里完成 246 个真实 issue，使用 2025 年初 AI 工具的一组实际比对照组慢 19%，而他们事前预测会快 24%，事后仍自认为快了 20%。这个感知缺口是编排者最需要警惕的偏差——你对并行的收益估计大概率偏高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆任务-依赖结构决定并行上限\">拆任务：依赖结构决定并行上限</h2><p>拆得好坏的标准不是「拆得细」，而是子任务之间是否少依赖、可独立验证。三个可操作的判据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>边界自足</strong>：目标、约束、完成标准写进任务本身，agent 不需要反复回来问人；</li>\n<li><strong>完成可判定</strong>：能被测试或明确验收标准判定的，尽量机器判定；</li>\n<li><strong>写明禁区</strong>：告诉 agent 不要碰哪些模块，把冲突消灭在派发时而非合并时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>spec-driven 工具链把这套纪律产品化了：GitHub Spec Kit 的定位就是「Define what to build before building it」——先产出规格，再驱动任意 coding agent 实现（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">github/spec-kit</a>，已发布 1.0.0）；AWS 的 Kiro 把规格定义为「将高层想法变成带跟踪的实现计划的结构化产物」，并原生支持并行任务执行（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">kiro.dev/docs</a>）。规格驱动的完整工作流见<a href=\"../ai-across-the-lifecycle/planning-and-design-with-ai\">规划与设计阶段</a>。</p>\n<p>反模式是按文件拆而不是按职责拆：两个 agent 各改同一个文件的两半，合并时的冲突消解成本通常超过并行省下的时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[&quot;大目标&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;拆解为少依赖子任务&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[&quot;agent 1 · worktree A&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[&quot;agent 2 · worktree B&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[&quot;agent n · worktree N&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[&quot;汇总与冲突消解&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{&quot;验证与审查通过?&quot;}&#10;  E -- &quot;否&quot; --&gt; B&#10;  E -- &quot;是&quot; --&gt; F[&quot;合入主线&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  A[\"大目标\"] --&gt; B[\"拆解为少依赖子任务\"]\n  B --&gt; C1[\"agent 1 · worktree A\"]\n  B --&gt; C2[\"agent 2 · worktree B\"]\n  B --&gt; C3[\"agent n · worktree N\"]\n  C1 --&gt; D[\"汇总与冲突消解\"]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{\"验证与审查通过?\"}\n  E -- \"否\" --&gt; B\n  E -- \"是\" --&gt; F[\"合入主线\"]</pre><h2 id=\"隔离-让并行不互相踩踏\">隔离：让并行不互相踩踏</h2><p>多个 agent 改同一片代码，冲突不是风险而是必然。Claude Code 官方最佳实践把 git worktree 列为并行会话的标准隔离手段——让各会话在隔离的 checkout 里工作，「编辑互不碰撞」；其 <code>/batch</code> 命令更进一步，把一次大改动拆给 5 到 30 个子 agent，每个在自己的 worktree 中工作、各自开 PR（来源：<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/best-practices\">Claude Code Best Practices</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离机制</th>\n<th>隔离什么</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子 agent 上下文</td>\n<td>对话上下文与工具权限</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>调研、搜索等只读任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git worktree</td>\n<td>工作副本</td>\n<td>低，同仓库多 checkout</td>\n<td>并行修改不同模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立分支 + PR</td>\n<td>变更历史与回滚单元</td>\n<td>中，需合并协调</td>\n<td>长任务、大迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块边界约定</td>\n<td>代码所有权</td>\n<td>需前期架构投入</td>\n<td>团队级长期并行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>隔离粒度要匹配任务粒度：只读任务用子 agent 的独立上下文就够了（Claude Code 内置的 Explore 子 agent 即只读设计），只有写入型任务才需要 worktree 级隔离。隔离过度会把汇总成本推回去，等于亲手调高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{coord}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>隔离还有一个常被忽视的维度：模型与权限。Claude Code 的每个子 agent 拥有独立的 system prompt、工具白名单与权限，可以把探索类任务路由到更便宜的模型来控制成本（来源：<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents\">Create custom subagents</a>）。把「能读不能写」「能用哪些工具」写进子 agent 定义，是比事后审查更便宜的约束——它把流程约定升级成了结构保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把关产能决定并行上限\">把关产能决定并行上限</h2><p>并行度真正的硬约束不在生成端，在审查端。DORA 对生成式 AI 的研究发现：AI 采用率每提升 25%，交付吞吐反而下降 1.5%、交付稳定性下降 7.2%——机制是 AI 让生成变快后变更批次变大，而大批次更难审查、更易引入不稳定（来源：<a href=\"https://dora.dev/ai/gen-ai-report/\">DORA: Impact of Generative AI in Software Development</a>）。审查是以人的注意力为单位的串行资源，于是并行度存在硬上界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\le R / r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是团队单位时间能审查的变更量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是单个 agent 的产出速率。超出这个界，多 agent 只是在更快地生产未审代码。把关如何按风险分级而不拖垮速度，见<a href=\"keeping-humans-in-the-loop\">保持人在环路</a>。</p>\n<p>两个被官方文档验证有效的缓解手段：一是 <strong>Writer/Reviewer 分工</strong>——让另一个全新上下文的会话专门审查，因为「fresh context 不会被自己刚写的代码偏袒」（Claude Code 文档给出的模式）；二是<strong>对抗式审查</strong>——审查子 agent 只看 diff 与验收标准、不看实现过程的推理，只报告影响正确性的缺口。但要警惕官方同时点名的副作用：被要求「找问题」的审查者几乎总会报出一些问题，逐条照单全收会导致过度设计与防御性代码泛滥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>编排多 agent 的收益与上限都有清晰的数学形状：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^* = \\sqrt{T_{\\text{work}}/T_{\\text{coord}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出最优并行度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\le R/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 给出硬顶。拆任务按职责不按文件，隔离按任务粒度选机制，把关产能跟不上时先降并行度——多 agent 不是加速旋钮，而是一个需要预算的分布式系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"编排多个 Agent","id":"编排多个-agent"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从单兵到编排者：收益有模型，代价也有","id":"从单兵到编排者-收益有模型-代价也有"},{"level":2,"text":"拆任务：依赖结构决定并行上限","id":"拆任务-依赖结构决定并行上限"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离：让并行不互相踩踏","id":"隔离-让并行不互相踩踏"},{"level":2,"text":"把关产能决定并行上限","id":"把关产能决定并行上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试与交付阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/ai-across-the-lifecycle/testing-and-delivery-with-ai"},"next":{"title":"保持人在环路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/team-workflows-and-collab